  _dialogueLines:
  - "Hey, mister ninja! You look scary\u2026 but kind of cool too!"
  - Nope! You look lost. My mom says lost people need something warm. Maybe soup!
  - Yay! But Mom needs some Shrimps to cook it!
  - Everyone needs soup. Even ninjas.
  - Only that they jump a lot and disappear! Can you disappear?
  - "Then let\u2019s fix that with soup!"
  - Thanks. Like I said, Ninja is so cool.
